## Heavy commands

This machine runs several agents at once on shared memory. Run every heavy command through `heavy`, which caps how many run at once and queues the rest:

```sh
heavy pnpm lint
```

Heavy means anything that loads the whole project: type-aware lint, typecheck, fallow, full test suites, builds. Time spent queued counts toward the command's timeout, so give it a long one or run it in the background.
